{"strongs": "H7251", "word": "רְבַע", "translit": "ra.va", "root": "רבע", "morph": "H:V", "pos": "verb denominative", "gloss": "squared, square", "definition": "[ רְבַע ] verb denominative , only Passive participle squared, square ; — Qal Passive participle רָבוּעַ square , of altar Exod 27:1 ; Exod 30:2 ; Exod 37:25 ; Exod 38:1 , compare Ezek 43:16 breastplate Ezek 30:2 ; Ezek 39:9 plural רְבֻעִים , of doorways, etc. [on text see Kit Benz ] 1Kgs 7:5 feminine singular רְבֻעָה as substantive = a square Ezek 41:21 (accusative Co Toy, omit מְזוּזַת , and joining ׳ ר to v Ezek 41:20 Krae reads מְזוּזתֹ רְבֻעֹת , compare 1Kgs 6:33 , רְבִייְִ 2. ). Pu`al Participle square , מְרֻבַּע Ezek 45:2 , of piece of land; feminine singular מְרֻבָּ֑עַת Ezek 40:47 , of court; feminine plural מְרֻבָּעוֺת 1Kgs 7:31 (opposed to עֲנֻלּוֺת ), of borders of bases (compare Sabean רבעתם , a kind of square building, SabDenkm 31 ).", "definition_html": "<h1><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7721')\">BDB7721</entry> [<entry onclick=\"sn('H7251')\">H7251</entry>]</h1><div class=\"navigation\"><entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7720')\">BDB7720</entry> | BIBLICAL HEBREW | <entry onclick=\"bdbid('BDB7722')\">BDB7722</entry></div><p> [<bdbheb>רְבַע</bdbheb>] <b>verb denominative</b>, only <highlight>Passive participle</highlight> <highlightword>squared, square</highlightword>; — <div class=\"point\"><b>Qal</b> <highlight>Passive participle</highlight> <bdbheb>רָבוּעַ</bdbheb> <highlight>square</highlight>, of altar <ref ref=\"Exod 27:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"27\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"27\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,27,1)\">Exod 27:1</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 30:2\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"30\" vBegin=\"2\" cEnd=\"30\" vEnd=\"2\" onclick=\"bcv(2,30,2)\">Exod 30:2</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 37:25\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"37\" vBegin=\"25\" cEnd=\"37\" vEnd=\"25\" onclick=\"bcv(2,37,25)\">Exod 37:25</ref>; <ref ref=\"Exod 38:1\" b=\"2\" cBegin=\"38\" vBegin=\"1\" cEnd=\"38\" vEnd=\"1\" onclick=\"bcv(2,38,1)\">Exod 38:1</ref>, compare <ref r