)\">1Kgs 7:31</ref> (opposed to <bdbheb>עֲנֻלּוֺת</bdbheb>), of borders of bases (compare Sabean <bdbheb>רבעתם</bdbheb>, a kind of square building, <lookup onclick=\"bdbabb('SabDenkm')\">SabDenkm<sup>31</sup></lookup>). </p></div><hr>", "references": [{"raw": "Exod 27:1", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 27, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Exod 30:2", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 30, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Exod 37:25", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 37, "verse": 25}, {"raw": "Exod 38:1", "book": "EXO", "chapter": 38, "verse": 1}, {"raw": "Ezek 43:16", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 43, "verse": 16}, {"raw": "Ezek 30:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 30, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 39:9", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 39, "verse": 9}, {"raw": "1Kgs 7:5", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 5}, {"raw": "Ezek 41:21", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 41, "verse": 21}, {"raw": "Ezek 41:20", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 41, "verse": 20}, {"raw": "1Kgs 6:33", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 6, "verse": 33}, {"raw": "Ezek 45:2", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 45, "verse": 2}, {"raw": "Ezek 40:47", "book": "EZK", "chapter": 40, "verse": 47}, {"raw": "1Kgs 7:31", "book": "1KI", "chapter": 7, "verse": 31}], "flagged": {"hebrew": ["רְבַע", "רָבוּעַ", "רְבֻעִים", "רְבֻעָה", "מְזוּזַת", "׳", "ר", "מְזוּזתֹ רְבֻעֹת", "רְבִייְִ", "מְרֻבַּע", "מְרֻבָּ֑עַת", "מְרֻבָּעוֺת", "עֲנֻלּוֺת", "רבעתם"], "aramaic": [], "greek": [], "translit": [], "abbreviations": ["Benz", "Co", "Kit", "Krae", "SabDenkm"]}, "covers": [], "bdbid": "BDB7721", "source": "BDB", "testament": "OT"}